#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/workforce/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Workforce"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/workforce/CONTEXT.md
msgid "This context covers the establishment of posts and the staff posted to them."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/workforce/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Language"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/workforce/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Staff member**: A person in the role of someone posted to a post. _Avoid_: Employee, personnel, worker"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/workforce/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Teacher**: A staff member posted to a teaching post. _Avoid_: Educator, instructor"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/workforce/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Post**: An established position at an institution, which exists whether or not anyone fills it. _Avoid_: Position, job, vacancy (a vacancy is an unfilled post)"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/workforce/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Posting**: The effective-dated placement of a staff member in a post, with the share of full time it represents. _Avoid_: Assignment (reserved for teaching), appointment, deployment"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/workforce/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Assignment**: The effective-dated record of a teacher teaching a subject to a class. _Avoid_: Allocation, timetable slot"
msgstr ""
